@startuml
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E74B5
  ActorBorderColor #0B2545
  LifeLineBorderColor #B8C4D1
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  ParticipantBorderColor #2E74B5
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8EEF5
  ParticipantFontColor #0B2545
}
hide footbox

title batchDispatchWhenFull() — 批量调度总时长最短 [Bonus]

actor "管理员" as A
boundary "调度模拟界面" as UI
control "FaultDispatchController" as C
control "DispatchService" as D
entity "ChargingPile" as P
A -> UI: 到站车辆填满全部车位，启动批量调度
UI -> C: batchDispatchWhenFull()
C -> D: batch_dispatch_when_full()
D -> D: 校验车辆数 = 充电区+等候区总车位
D -> D: 收回全部未充电车辆为一组(不分快/慢充)
D -> D: _greedy_any_mode 使完成总时长最短地分配到任意桩
D -> P: 分配入队
D --> C: {dispatched, totalFinishMinutes}
C --> UI: 展示批量调度结果
@enduml
